## 3. Use the custom URL in your style / source

### a) In a raw JSON style (e.g. stored in `assets/style.json`)

```json
{
  "version": 8,
  "sources": {
    "my-vault-tiles": {
      "type": "vector",
      "tiles": [ "vault://tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}" ],
      "minzoom": 0,
      "maxzoom": 14
    }
  },
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "roads",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "my-vault-tiles",
      "source-layer": "road",
      "paint": { "line-color": "#ff6600", "line-width": 2 }
    }
  ]
}
```

### b) Programmatically (Kotlin)

```kotlin
val source = VectorSource(
    "my-vault-tiles",
    "vault://tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}"
)

mapboxMap?.addSource(source)
```

The SDK will call your `VaultRequestHandler` for every tile request that matches the pattern.

