## 8. TL;DR – One-liner answer

> **On Android the equivalent of `maplibregl.addProtocol()` is to supply a custom `HttpRequestHandler` (via `MapLibreOptions.httpRequestHandler`) when you initialise the SDK. Inside `handleRequest()` you recognise the `vault://…` scheme, decrypt the stored MVT bytes, and return them as an `HttpResponse` with an `InputStream`. The style JSON can keep the `vault://tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}` URLs unchanged.**
